<title>USA: Marcellus CSD, Mich won by EVEREN Securities.</title>
<headline>Marcellus CSD, Mich won by EVEREN Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said it won $3.530 million of Marcellus CSD, Mich., 1997 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.29 percent.</p>
</text>
